cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this harness in research on AI-assisted software engineering,
  deterministic agent guardrails, or provenance-verified code generation,
  please cite it as below.
type: software
title: expo-postgres-agent-harness
abstract: >-
  A deterministic agent harness for Expo (React Native) + Hono + Drizzle /
  Postgres 16 pnpm monorepos shipped to the Apple App Store and Google Play
  via EAS Build and Submit: Claude Code hooks that gate turn completion on a
  green validation chain, security-invariant lint rules and pre-write guards,
  row-level-security isolation tests against real Postgres, Expo config
  policy gates (ATS, permissions, plugins, CNG purity), an inline-citation
  provenance pipeline, and supply-chain-hardened CI.
authors:
  - name: Cogvera Labs
repository-code: 'https://github.com/BhodiSea/expo-postgres-agent-harness'
license: Apache-2.0
version: 0.1.1
